    "searchText": "urgent convoy refuel critical fleet refuel refueling_stanton_both_1xl_2l_rank5 united wayfarers club careercontract standing refuel pickup: stanton heyo,\n\nover at [location] we just got a refueling job for an entire small fleet of ships who all together need [fueltype]. talk about when it rains it pours!\n\nthe client will pay you at the rate of [refuelrequest], and as a united wayfarers club contractor, you will also qualify for the uwc service fee listed above upon completion.\n\nunfortunately, where they're held up isn't the nicest of sectors so i'd be alert for any tomfoolery while you're doing the run. \n\nit'll be best to try get them all back on their way as soon as you can.\n\nhappy trails,\n\ndina deloit\ndispatch hub\nunited wayfarers club\n\"we’ve got your back\" critical refuel request: refuel request: 1128fd25-1fb1-4406-ad92-c802cfa65588 4a8e0eaf-3426-40ff-a928-23a258a576c5 517f3094-eeaf-4177-8d4f-8eb2c96f9d87 6b73fc99-0dc7-478f-89cd-a861ced1e833 ab8e2944-d6cd-425e-a6e4-6a8e1abe61cd bf7770b6-5d56-49a3-80b1-5e28643b1fec 422acb7c-0666-452a-b259-29941012370e adebbccc-fff4-46f6-8dac-9cb9be474b52 0485507c-e88b-4a9d-aeec-4a528087921c 593b983c-0f26-4674-82e4-81cac04106ec a17c4abc-d8e2-4921-8070-e5aa56f665a5 c6e070d0-ac7b-4f80-a941-772fb0de9981 d5f675d6-2e55-4931-b3da-9dd2d6e95709 0b862c68-8b32-40af-96ed-40a0dbc1c47c 3ab903b3-3c9b-48a4-aa60-1d6050a53aa8 3b19d365-3ff9-4980-9eac-f04da407499f 4f4ff99e-0440-41e7-9071-8a84e0e61af5 51e8d38f-6a18-4b95-afd6-8f82ff5564c2 b4593eb8-3ad0-407c-906b-4a5a0c97ed94 f4723ecc-5927-4fdc-a238-9318f491ba12 blueprint: fuel nozzle: 6f0487ce-1696-4b62-abb4-587d30d0e6da, 990aa98f-0674-466f-9875-113d414d690b, dbe5c153-2149-4843-9b03-297f3e66d092, 96566b51-4fed-4711-ae6e-9565f54a1ffa +4 standing +200 19,750 auec standing +100 49,250 auec"
